ge.swift: exit 0.\\n- git diff --check: exit 0.\\n- ./scripts/check-core-boundaries.sh: exit 0.\\n- make credential-free-validate: exit 0, including relay bootstrap/packaging, deterministic generation, macOS build/contracts, core boundaries, Swift Testing, Swift release build, native packaging, and legacy preservation/build gates.\\n\\n## Safety\\nEvidence is privacy-safe. No signing, installation, application or provider launch, VPN preference mutation, VPN activation, route change, or DNS change ran. Credential-free validation explicitly reported signing and downstream physical/release gates as NOT RUN.\\n\\n## Files\\n- Tests/ReluxTunnelHarnessTests/HarnessTests.swift\\n- LOGBOOK.md\\n\", type=outcome, description=\"Handoff evidence\")'" in /Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel
